## WhatsApp login (Baileys)

On first `npm start` a QR code is printed in the terminal: scan it from
WhatsApp on your phone (Settings → Linked devices → Link a device). Auth state
is saved under `./wappa-auth`, so later starts reconnect without a QR scan.

> **Warning — unofficial client.** Baileys is not an official WhatsApp API.
> Using it may violate WhatsApp's Terms of Service and can get your number
> banned. Use a number you can afford to lose, and prefer the official Cloud
> API (`npm create wappa-agent -- --transport cloud-api`) for production.
